### Export SODSI — 5 hojas + ficha proyecto + catálogos
### QA: proyecto #6 completado sede 2 año 2024 · #7 planificación

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@emailConsultor = consultor@ods.local
@passwordConsultor = Consultor2026!
@emailGestor = ana.garcia@ods.cr
@passwordGestor = password123
@sedeId = 2
@anio = 2024
@idCompletado = 6
@idPlanificacion = 7

### @name login_consultor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{emailConsultor}}",
  "password": "{{passwordConsultor}}"
}

@consultorToken = {{login_consultor.response.body.token}}

### @name login_gestor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{emailGestor}}",
  "password": "{{passwordGestor}}"
}

@gestorToken = {{login_gestor.response.body.token}}

# ── Catálogos SODSI ──

### GET /api/sodsi/catalogos → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sodsi/catalogos
Authorization: Bearer {{consultorToken}}

# ── Ficha proyecto (POJOs JOOQ) ──

### GET ficha SODSI proyecto #6 → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{idCompletado}}/sodsi
Authorization: Bearer {{consultorToken}}

### GET ficha SODSI proyecto #7 → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{idPlanificacion}}/sodsi
Authorization: Bearer {{gestorToken}}

# ── Export consolidado SODSI (5 hojas) ──

### GET consolidado sede+año — consultor 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/projects/excel?sedeId={{sedeId}}&anio={{anio}}
Authorization: Bearer {{consultorToken}}

### GET export individual #6 — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/proyecto/{{idCompletado}}
Authorization: Bearer {{consultorToken}}

# ── Gestor consolidado → 403 ──

### GET consolidado — gestor 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/projects/excel?sedeId={{sedeId}}&anio={{anio}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gestorToken}}
